# Sheet music stays local: this repo is public (GitHub Pages on a free account
# requires it) and most of these scores are still in copyright. Public-domain
# pieces are whitelisted below; everything else is imported on-device instead.
# scores/manifest.json is generated by vite.config.ts from the files present.
public/scores/*
!public/scores/.gitkeep
!public/scores/public-domain/
